---
title: Log
layout: base
permalink: /log/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: false
---

<div class="log">
  <h1>Outpost</h1>
  <p>A running journal of thoughts, progress, and observations — follow along the trail.</p>

  {% if collections.posts | length %}
    <ul class="log-list">
      {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
        <li>
          <a href="{{ post.url | url }}">
            <span class="log-date">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
            <span class="log-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  {% else %}
    <p>No entries yet. The trail is quiet…</p>
  {% endif %}
</div>
